  //Class_Book

  "ctt_Class_Book_1":"Swan\nThe Knight\n\nThe original discoverer of the Tower, Swan is a swordsman who was cursed with frightning ambition and is excellent for beginers or advanced players!",
  "ctt_Class_Book_2":"Laozi\nThe Tank\n\nLaozi was found unconcious at the top of the Tower, after being helped he decided to help climb the Tower.\n\nLaozi has a Defensive playstyle, he has great armor and high attack speed.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_3":"Little Timmy \nThe Weakling\n\nLittle Timmy is a small child who ran a little too far from home when playing tag.\n\nHe stumbled upon the Tower and decided to enter it.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_4":"Little Timmy is very fragile and cannot regenerate health.\n\nHe is the worst character in the game so it\'s not recommended to play as him unless you\'re up for a challenge.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_5":"Joey \nThe Vampire\n\nJoey is a Variant of Super. After breaking out of the White Cake Lab with his friends, Joey decided to join Cake Team and climb the Tower. His appetite for blood grows stronger everyday.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_6":"He acts pretty sophisticated but at times he will let out a few jokes here and there.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_7":"B\'\nThe Brawler\n\nB\' was created by The Summoner at Henry\'s demand in order to create a version of Ben that didn\'t like bees, so that Henry could still be friends with Ben if he had to kill the original",
  "ctt_Class_Book_8":"B\' now climbs the Tower to get revenge on the two for how he was treated in the lab, using a variety of boxing gloves to fight.\n\nHowever, problems in his genetics prevent him from using active items or magic.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_9":"Lazy\nThe Archer\n\nA mediocre marksman- er, marksduck? Anyways, he specializes in archery, taking on enemies from a distance while his pet dog deals with enemies who come close. \n\n",
  "ctt_Class_Book_10":"He\'s pretty cocky, thinking he can take on just about anybody in a fight. Unfortunately, he often fails miserably on account of being...not the brightest.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_11":"Thew\nThe Gunslinger\n\nThew is a firearms expert who brings a variety of ballistic weapons to the Tower. \nThey are here on a recon mission to figure out what secrets the Tower actually contains.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_12":"Their training on the field allows them to retrieve ammunition from fallen enemies, while also being decently quick on their feet.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_13":"Wazy\nThe Time Ninja\n\nWazy is an Assassin hired by ??? to find someone in the Tower, he only helps Cake Team because their goals are alined at the moment",
  "ctt_Class_Book_14":"He is a ninja that has the ability to control the hands of a clock.\nHe uses them as throwing knives, and even has special abilities related to time.\n\nHis name starts with a W, because W stands for winning, and he always Wins",
  "ctt_Class_Book_15":"Henry\nThe Ant Leader\n\nHenry is the leader of the Ants, he has helped lead their kind to the state that they are in now.\n\nHe uses his army of Ants to help reach the top of the Tower.\n",
  "ctt_Class_Book_16":"Henry and Ben were friends in their childhood, until the incident that gave Ben control over bees caused Henry to grow distant out of jealousy. \n\nYears later, Henry arrived at the Tower with an army of ants and tried to kill the bees himself. ",
  "ctt_Class_Book_17":"However, he was stopped by the Tower explorers, and now has decided to join them in climbing the Tower.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_18":"Super\nThe Mage\n\nA powerful mage who harnesses nature magic to conjure up elemental flowers from their world to fight his enemies. He\'s quite the expressive jokester, but knows just how to get the job done.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_19":"Nelfin\nThe Protector\n\nA crystal variant Moose who traveled from a different timeline to help climb the Tower.\n\nHe is a mage that uses the energy from Otherside to fight with Magic Crystals",
  "ctt_Class_Book_20":"Dark Swan\nThe Dark Warlock\n\nDark Swan is a variant of Swanlet... His soul substitute was a Badge of Darkness...\n\nUnlike Swan, Dark Swan is very pessimistic and edgy. He is a master of Dark Magic.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_21":"Moose\nThe Doctor\n\nAn expert in the field of medicine and flamboyant comedy machine. He may be weak physically, but his healing is unmatched.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_22":"Ben\nThe Beekeeper\n\nA reluctant beekeeper who stumbled upon the Tower. He somehow gained a deep connection with the bees here and can use their honey to boost his allies\' health.\nThere seems to be a war brewing though..",
  "ctt_Class_Book_23":"Swan Jelly\nThe Jelly Man\n\nSwan Jelly is a variant of Swanlet. He is made of a jelly-like substance. This allows him to slide on walls, giving him a notable speed boost.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_24":"His healing is focused on slow, gradual healing over time. Swan Jelly takes a lot of damage from attacks, but can regenerate it back quickly.\n\nSwan Jelly is the most laid back of all the Swans",
  "ctt_Class_Book_25":"JJ\nThe Fisherman\n\nJJ is an aspiring fisherman who uses the Tower\'s population of fish to help keep his health high. He always seems to have a plan, but it never quite works out.\nJJ fights using large hooks and his trusty pet dog, Super Jay.",
  "ctt_Class_Book_26":"Smash the Wildcard\n\n\nSmash is a local bread baker that decided to climb the Tower...\n\nHowever he is completly random.\n\nEvery game as him he has different items and stats",
  "ctt_Class_Book_27":"Nut\nThe ???\n\nNobody knows who he, she, or it is",

