  //Break_Room_Book

  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_1":"Day #3\n\nSeems whenever I enter the tower its completly different. Infact, some dungeons are outdoors. This tower must be magical or something. But what is powering it?",
  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_2":"How are you reading this?\nIf you\'re a developer working on this area, why? This place hasn\'t changed for months. I assume you have some reason, though, so don\'t let me stop you.\n\n...Heh, who am I kidding?\nYou\'re just a dirty cheater, aren\'t you?",

  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_3":"Day #255\n\nDon\'t let these enemies hit you!\n\nThey like to steal your items, and worse—when you finally think they\'re defeated, they get right back up.\n\n",

  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_4":"Hello its me Swanlet.\n\n\nWelcome to the hall of fame.\n\nThis is where everyone who completed this ending can write their name down to become perminate to the tower",
  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_5":"This room must have been taken from my memories because it used to be from this cavern my friends and I used to explore, but now its in this tower ;)",
  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_6":"Hey all, Ben here\n\n",

  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_7":"Glatiatus\'s Journal:\n\n\nTheres a mysterious gateway at the bottom of the tower... I have to make sure nobody enters it... as far as I know only David and I know the horrors ahead",
  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_8":"I know a Noble Knight should never question his orders but...\n\nI\'m starting to wonder if the creater of the tower is the person they say they are...",

  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_9":"Hello and thank you for playing Cake Team Towers, if you\'ve made it this far that must mean you really like the game so I\'m glad I was able to make something you enjoy\n\n:D\n\nIf your hungry for more content, don\'t worry",
  "ctt_Break_Room_Book_10":"Keep on playing and you\'ll find\n\n Cake Team Towers\n     Chapter 2\n\n  ~World War Bee~",

