  "ctt_Proson_Book_1":"I hate being the Janitor here, the ceiling keeps leaking... Its almost as if this entire prison is underwater. I QUIT\n\nI\'m going to work at Charleston chungus",
  "ctt_Proson_Book_2":"Mysterious Fishers Log.\n\nAfter years of traveling through the sea I\'ve finally found it...\n\nThe Oculus Sea...\n\nLegends have it a powerful sea monster roams around those parts of the Ocean",
  "ctt_Proson_Book_3":"The Oculus Sea is also where Muck Island is...\n\nI was warned never to go to Muck Island, but I must find the Sea Monster...\n\nToday I will enter the heart of the Oculus Sea... Where the sea monster guards his treasure...",
  "ctt_Proson_Book_4":"The Jaintor QUIT!?!\n\nNow the entire dungeon is eroding\n\nsooner or later this whole place will flood!",

