  //The_Lab_Book

  "ctt_The_Lab_Book_1":"Proffesor G Log Book\n------------------\n\nToday might be the most important day of my life...\n\nThe White Cake has hired me with an important task.\n\nThey need a scientist on their team",
  "ctt_The_Lab_Book_2":"Apparently there were 4 huge explosions around the land, and they want me to investigate them... the first one was in Otherside... some strange stuff has been happening there. Im excited to check that out",

  //Sky_Scraper_Book

  "ctt_Sky_Scraper_Book_1":"Day #35\n\nThe windows of this building gives me the creeps, its almost as if its starting into my soul",
  "ctt_Sky_Scraper_Book_2":"Day #104\n\nI\'ve been trying to figure out how this tower came to be, but I just can\'t figure out a proper theory. My original theory was that Kamacete created this tower but I don\'t have enough evidence...",
  "ctt_Sky_Scraper_Book_3":"Maybe when I reach the top all my answers will be solved",
  "ctt_Sky_Scraper_Book_4":"if you\'re reading this, send all complaints about Cake Team Towers to caketeamimpersonator@gmail.com",
  "ctt_Sky_Scraper_Book_5":"HA, I bet you thought\nthis was gonna be some intese lore.\n\nNOPE!\n\nyou just wasted like 3 seconds of your life",
  "ctt_Sky_Scraper_Book_6":"Maria\'s Journal\n\nI can\'t seem to get my Medical license\n\nApparently some of my methods were \"controversal\"\n\nLuckily for me the White Cake decided to hire me, despite me not having a REAL PHD",
  "ctt_Sky_Scraper_Book_7":"I can\'t wait to join the Medical team. I heard Doctor Wormhole is there, it\'ll be nice to have someone I know. I wonder what they want me to do <3",

