  //Overgrown_Book

  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_1":"Overgrown has been dangerous to adventure in... seems that the goddess of Otherside view humans as a threat, I blame the white cake",
  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_2":"Seems that this area\nhas alot of cracked rocks... maybe if I hit it with an explosion it will open it up!",
  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_3":"Day #200\nThis dungeon seems to be a different season depending on the season outside of the tower... interesting",
  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_4":"As fall arrives Folia prepairs for hybernation...\n\nWhen spring comes we attack!",
  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_5":"Day #1\n\nWoah What the heck, this place is way to big to fit inside the tower, its like that tent from Harry Potter?!\n\nThis tower must be cursed, or blessed...\n\nIs it teleporting me?\nAm I in a new dimention?",
  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_6":"I have to get to the bottom of this....\n\n\n\nor- I guess the Top of this ;)",
  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_7":"These humans keep on visiting our land and destroying it...\n\nFloria will use the power of mother nature to defeat those greedy beings",
  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_8":"Aid is being transported, but it seems as if we\'ve hit an iceberg. I guess White Cake won\'t be getting their medical supplies as of right now. Speaking of which, this might be my last log. If you are reading this, continue forth and get in-contact with White Cake A.S.A.P.",
  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_9":"Merry Chirstmas from Cake Team!\n",
  "ctt_Overgrown_Book_10":"Spring is soon, I can\'t wait\n\nFloria will kill all those Humans!!!",

