  //Charleston_Chungus_Book

  "ctt_Charleston_Chungus_Book_1":"My name is Doctor Wormhole.\n\nI am one of the first people in the world who will study the recently-discovered Elementium.\n\nBut, to be honest, the real reason I wanted to become a scientist was...",
  "ctt_Charleston_Chungus_Book_2":"...because I believed there was more to this world.\n\nThe Nether always fascinated me - a foreign realm, connected to our own by a simple portal.\n\nIt got me thinking, \'there had to be more\'...",
  "ctt_Charleston_Chungus_Book_3":"...surely, the Nether cannot be the only dimension to be discovered?",
  "ctt_Charleston_Chungus_Book_4":"My name is Doctor Wormhole,\n\nI am one of the first people who will study elementium.\n\nBut to be honest, the real reason I wanted to become a scientist is because I believed there was more to this world.",
  "ctt_Charleston_Chungus_Book_5":"The nether fascinated me... A portal that takes us to a realm different than ours.\n\nIt got me thinking, there had to be more... the nether cannot be the only one",

