  "ctt_Haunted_Mansion_Book_1":"Once per year, every halloween... I possess the power to awaken",
  "ctt_Haunted_Mansion_Book_2":"Hello my name is Chuckster, I was hired here to help take care of the mansion.\n\nOnce the Mansion became haunted I retired.\n\nI\'m leaving this note for the Mansion Owner.\nSorry I quit, but you got a ghost problem",

