  "ctt_Lost_World_Sign_1":"Gregory",

  //Lost_World_Book

  "ctt_Lost_World_Book_1":"Dear Brother.\n\nIts been a year now since you\'ve past away...\n\nIts hard to keep going on, but we hired a doctor... maybe she can bring you back from the dead... I will not stop until I can fix you\n-Magum",
  "ctt_Lost_World_Book_2":"Day #250-something\n\nAfter an attempt at reaching the top, I saw someone else enter the tower. They were bleeding down their face and didn\'t talk to me...\nI thought I was the only one climbing this thing.",
  "ctt_Lost_World_Book_3":"Day 251\n\nWhen I reached the top of the tower, instead of it being empty, there was a huge tunnel. I decided to jump down it and found myself in a whole new world...",
  "ctt_Lost_World_Book_4":"How have I never found this place before? It must have been recently created.\\n\\nI think I finally figured out how these dungeons keep getting created and why new ones appear.",
  "ctt_Lost_World_Book_5":"*The rest of the pages seem to be torn.*",

