  "ctt_Parties_World_Sign_1":"START MINIGAME",

  //Parties_World_Book

  "ctt_Parties_World_Book_1":"Coaster Chaos is a Mario Party Minigame in which players must race across a rollar coaster and dodge obstacles.\n\nNow this minigame exists in the bottom of the Tower",

  //Davids_Pinball_Machine_Book

  "ctt_Davids_Pinball_Machine_Book_1":"Day #252\n\nI have finally discovered the secret to how this tower has so many unique worlds.",
  "ctt_Davids_Pinball_Machine_Book_2":"The worlds seem to be constantly created, theres no way a tower alone is able to create such complex worlds. Theres only one explaination.",
  "ctt_Davids_Pinball_Machine_Book_3":"The tower accesses the visitors brains and uses past memories of places as blue prints.\n\nThat explains why theres some areas that look so fimiliar.\n\nAnd why some levels have video game or cartoon characters like a big rabbit.",
  "ctt_Davids_Pinball_Machine_Book_4":"Glatiatus, Badgey, and the others are trapped in this tower on an endless loop, are they memories or the real people?",
  "ctt_Davids_Pinball_Machine_Book_5":"Day #252\n\nI think the tower is going through people\'s brains... I wonder if that is affecting us mentally?\n\nThis is why nobody should enter the tower.\n\n",
  "ctt_Davids_Pinball_Machine_Book_6":"Day #252\n\nAnd finally, the Arced Void.\n\nI swear this was never here before. It\'s a brand-new area.\n\nWhich means there\'s someone in the tower that\'s causing all these new levels to be created.",
  "ctt_Davids_Pinball_Machine_Book_7":"If I go further down, I\'ll find the source of these new levels...\n\n",
  "ctt_Davids_Pinball_Machine_Book_8":"Arced Void?\n\nWhat does that mean, though? My theory is that it\'s an anagram for something else.\n\nBut what...",

  //Anthill_Thrill_Book

