  //Treasure_Trove_Cove_Book

  "ctt_Treasure_Trove_Cove_Book_1":"They say the Oculus Sea is between Treasure Trove Cove and Muck Island...\n\nBut Muck Island is a myth!\n\nLegends have it, in the heart of the Oculus sea, There is a magic gem that lets you breathe underwater.",
  "ctt_Treasure_Trove_Cove_Book_2":"I used to own everything, I found out this island was a gold mine and had 100 employees mining it and I was rich.\nBut then this guy at the casino said I could be a big shot..\n\nNow all I have is this Sea Pickle...",
  "ctt_Treasure_Trove_Cove_Book_3":"Captain E\'s Log.\n\nToday has been a succesful day, hiring Shy guys was a great idea since their minimum wage is so low.",
  "ctt_Treasure_Trove_Cove_Book_4":"The shyguys have made me alot of weapons out of the gold we mined, which we sold to the Bees and the Ants...\n\nAs long as their war continues I will keep making money. I hope they\'ll stay enemies.",
  "ctt_Treasure_Trove_Cove_Book_5":"I am leaving this island for now to get back to the Circus. We\'re having a big event that\'ll make me LOTS of money.\n\nI just hope those two Skeletons bring me a Gorilla... They sure like to take their time",
  "ctt_Treasure_Trove_Cove_Book_6":"Spell out the letters \"CAKE\" to win!",
  "ctt_Treasure_Trove_Cove_Book_7":"Sometimes I feel like i\'ve been inside of this hotel my whole life... almost like im just decoration or something for someone else to look at... are we all even real, what is reality, I can\'t escape these thoughts-\nuh I mean, The sun feels great in the morning",

  //Lonely_Cabin_Book

  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_1":"Journal Entry #58 -\n11/3/??\n\nIt has been years since I have even seen another person. This isolation has been slowly deteriorating my sanity. I have seen the same dull sunset every dawn. I wander these halls, ever-waiting for my",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_2":"resolve. I grow wearier of insanity every day. Now, nothing can satiate my everlasting hunger for something to do... anything to do. It is as if my only friend is this cabin, this place I call home. But even my only friend mocks me. It\'s as if these very walls laugh at my",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_3":"expense, taunting me as I woefully walk down these halls. I am alone.\n\nThis isn\'t a cry for help, rather, me giving up. I\'m \"throwing in the towel\", I believe the expression goes. I am unsure for it has been ages since I\'ve had a conversation other than",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_4":"with the man in the mirror. This life of solitude and isolation is insufferable. I thought I had to leave everything... everyone to reach the happiness I sought. Yet, all I have found is misery. My mind is beginning to implode, caving into the silence... the echoed",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_5":"footsteps... the loneliness. I am going insane, there is no denying that but can I control it? Can I contain this decay? Honestly, I do not think I have the energy, nor the will, to attempt such a feat. I have given up. You\'re already aware of this notion. It is easier to just let this corruption",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_6":"consume me. Let me spiral into madness. I am alone.\n\nThere is only one concern... what will I become? Isolation can turn a man into a monster and I fear that this situation will result in the same consequence. Due to this, I am going to end it.",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_7":"Please do not be mistaken, I do not wish to end my life. ",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_8":"I don\'t have blue hair lol.",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_9":" No, not end it, rather preserve it. My time alone, although brought many hardships, has been fruitful in regard to my scientific ventures. I have produced a substance that can make my body",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_10":"idle, yet sustain it. It is a combination of my own biological achievements and material I unearthed in the \"otherside\". My body shall lay dormant in the crypt underneath this property. It shall remain alongside my fortune deep within the sewers. I have",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_11":"concealed the entrance under my well to prevent anyone from uncovering it, not for many years at least. There is only one way to unlock the passage. A button which rests on the balcony of my cabin will reveal the sewers to you, dear reader. Hopefully, you are not",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_12":"traped within its walls and spend eternity alone. Believe me when I say it is one of the most humbling experiences anyone can undergo. Before I depart, I must warn you that the substance in which I am preserving my body in has... unwelcoming repercussions.",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_13":"There is a minor chance that the compounds within the substance can alter me. Whether it deforms my appearance or shapes me into a Lovecraftian creature, I could not tell you. But hopefully my body is never unveiled... Thus concluding my final journal entry.",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_14":"I am alone.\n\n~ ",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_15":"Colin",

  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_16":"I\'ve heard of this legend... a blind beast who lives underground... he can\'t see you... but he can hear you...\n\nhe hears everything...\n\n\nhe destroys everything...\n\nHe is the guardian of..",
  "ctt_Lonely_Cabin_Book_17":"Trolled :)",

