  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_1":"Buford Diary...\n\n\nAlright today is the day, todays the day I tell Bella I love her.\n\n\nI really hope she feels the same way.",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_2":"These god damn Dirt eaters are really getting out of hand. What are we gonna do without Bettys honey?\n\nNow what excuse am I supposed to use when I\'m late for work, can\'t tell them that I just had a bunch of Honey and woke up stungover",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_3":"If someone wants to Bee my boyfriend. They better give me every flower in the WORLD.\n\nAnd no way are they getting my honey if they come to my house with no peaceful rose~",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_4":"A dirt eater went to my school.\n\nWe became friends, but then my parents told me that we don\'t communicate with those bugs.\n\nIts a shame because I really liked him.\n\nHe probably drinks ant juice- Gross",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_5":"Back in my day Ants and Bees lived together in peace and harmoney.\n\nI think its those blah blah phones thats getting them all buzzed up.\n\nAnts can be sweet too. Kids these days need to stop cancling everyone\n",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_6":"When my crew and I went out to the Oculus sea to grab some Elementium... We found this weird island, its called Muck Island.\n\n\nIt is now my religion. sorry Ben",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_7":"This is bad this is BAD!\n\nBuford is gonna ask Bella OUT.\n\nApoligises for using the name of god in vain but BLAH BLAH BLOODY HELL.\n\nNobody wants a guy that can make Honey... Maybe I should learn to bake a cake...",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_8":"Wanna hear some tea! I heard both Baljeet AND Buford like Bella.\n\nWho is gonna win her over, Bufords got a bigger stinger but Baljeet knows how to make some good honey! ",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_9":"Buzz and I have our Honeymoon soon, I can\'t wait its gonna be so sweet.\n\nI just hope no Ants bug us, they broke into our hive recently and killed Betty. I feel so bad for Buck- But don\'t worry the second coming of Ben is soon... he will save us",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_10":"Yooo whats poppin\' Bee nation and welcome to BUZZfeeeed!!! In this video I am going to ask people about the Bee Ant Conflict!!!\n\nIf this video gets 100 stings I will drink Ant Juice LIVE ON TWITCHTB\nThis videos sponsered by Honey",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_11":"My girlfriend Brittney wants us to call eachother cute nicknames. But I don\'t know what one to use...\nBaby? Babe? Sugar? Love? Darling? Hot Stuff? My Beloved?\n\nIf only there was a nickname couples used that was sweet, and reminded us of something tastey...",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_12":"My parents left me home alone to fight the Ants.\n\nI can\'t wait until I turn 18 so I can start teaching those dirt eaters a lesson!",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_13":"Buford Diary...\n\nI used to not believe in Global Warming, but its been pretty hot here lately, the honey is melting way more than its supposed to!",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_14":"Day 2\n\nA giant river of lava just melted our statue of Ben WTF!!!\n\nNow theres Piglins and crap in here, thats it im moving to Antopolis",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_15":"Barrys Diary\n\nJust got fired from my job. Those blaze rods really did a number on me last night, couldn\'t focus on work",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_16":"Bettys Diary\n\nThese piglins give me the ick!\n\nI\'m leaving this place",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_17":"I am trapped in my hive forever...\n\nEternal Solitude",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_18":"I only have two words\n",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_19":"global warming",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_20":"I tried giving the Piglins my honey... they didn\'t like it. However, they do like gold... I\'ve given them all my gold, all they give me in return is gravel and sticks... would be nice for them to give me some enderpearls so I could teleport outta here",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_21":"Wow all this drama with our home being invaded by Piglins is HYPE! I made 3 videos about cancelling Magum, our views are off the roof!",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_22":"It happened just like that... Brittney and I were out for a morning stroll... a Piglin brute struck her in the head... she never woke up.\n\nI will get my revenge",
  "ctt_Bee_Hive_Book_23":"I can\'t BEElieve im saying this but. I liked it better when we were being invaded by Ants... the Piglins have burned our home!",

