  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_1":"Aidens ant juice is closed to depression\n\n\n\nMy family was killed by bees, I have no more hope...\n\n\nWhich is why I joined Henry, I want to be the one to kill Ben",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_2":"I saw a Flower Sniffer today.\n\nIt looked at me kinda funny...but it was kinda cute~\n\nBut...I like Ants. I can\'t like a Bee...\n\nWhat do I do?",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_3":"Whats up, its the Top A Antdrew Tate.\n\nIf you wanna be a real Alpha Ant, stop drinking that nerdy Ant juice and get some Sparkling Ant Juice!\n\nAlso what color is your \"bug\"atti",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_4":"The Bees took my father, atleast we make prisons, but the bees throw them into the honey pit... He\'ll never survive!\n\nI am joining Henry tonight for the war, bees will be squished!\nFor my father...",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_5":"Back in the day we used to live with the Bees, but our homes were too crouded, Henry found us and gave us this home.\n\nBut I think the Bees got jealos because they started saying that we were stealing our honey even tho we don\'t even like honey.",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_6":"Eventually they destroyed one of the buildings here, once that happened bees and ants would often fight with eachother- things just got worse and worse.\n\nIf it wasn\'t for the Bees blaming us for stealing their honey, none of this war would happen.",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_7":"What? the bees and ants are at war?\n\nI didn\'t know that... i\'ve been in my room watching Dragon Ball, Dragon Ball Z, and Dragon Ball Super for the last year...",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_8":"What is GOING ON ANT TRIBE!!!\nIn this video, I will be playing Ant Team Towers! we are going to try and beat Nightmare Bloodless against the hardest boss in the game... The FURY ANT EATER!\nMake sure to tune in on Saturday for the Aaron Vs Blake Boxing Match",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_9":"I always thought all this \"Bees are evil\" was just propaganda... that was until the \"great death spiral\"\n\nWhere the bees killed over 50 ants from my colony...\n\nYou see when us Ants march together we follow the person infront of us...",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_10":"The leader takes us to the destination... only this time the Bees made us go off track and run in a circle- the leader ant found the last ant in the line and started following him, forgetting he was the leader... All of the Ants were marching 1 by 1 in a circle... blindlessly following the one infront",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_11":"Eventually, the ants grew tired- and died...",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_12":"Ever since we got that Elementium our city has been booming, the entire citys powered by Elementium, I can play Pocket Ants all day with no power bill!\n\nWe are now way more technologically advanced than the bees, they stand no chance even if Ben helps them!!!!",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_13":"Henry made eye contect with me once...\n\n\nI am henrys biggest fan...\n\nI love him....\n\nI want to be him...\n\nSorry- sometimes I c\"ant\" control myself",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_14":"I finally found out how to make Ant Juice\n\n-1 tbs Soul Sand\n\n-2 Grapes\n\n-1 Cup of salt water\n\n-Stir with 2 tbs of jelly\n\nAnd hurrah! hurrah!\nyou made ant juice",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_15":"Ashley makes the best Ant Juice, its so sour! Way better than that gross \"Honey\" the flower sniffers tried to sell me.\n\nBut I was nice enough to eat it infront of them.\n\nMy mother always taught me not to be a red ant am I right",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_16":"I love Henry and all, but Mother of all anthills WHY did he think it was a good idea to have the highway drive through my house...",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_17":"Ever since we found Elementium and became technologicaly advanced kids these days just fly around on their planes...\n\nBack in my day we exercised by marching one by one\n\nOh well, atleast we can 1-up the bees",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_18":"Hey its me Ace!\n\nI invented the planes that the Ants use.\n\nWith the power of elementium we strived enough for us Ants to have much more free time- So I could quit my dead end job at Apple Ants to start my passion of building planes!",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_19":"I respect Anabelle for going to war against the Bees.\n\nShe\'s quite admirable to say the very least.\n\nIf I keep her safe through this, then I plan on making her my bride.",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_20":"I love Henry so much.\n\nI hope he comes back, ever since he climbed the tower I haven\'t seen him\n\n\n\n\nI love henry",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_21":"You know... I can\'t believe im saying this but I think I liked the Bee war more than this",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_22":"What is GOING ON ANT TRIBE!!!\nIn this video, I will be playing Ant Team Towers! we are going to try and beat THE ANT TRIALS. this next dugeon has a hellstone piglin, karma challenge, AND it has the heatwave curse... but there a Buck Ally space ahead!!!",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_23":"Wow that grape elixer tastes so good!\n\nBut this pink haired pirate stole it all from me... damn pirates!",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_24":"I knew this would happen",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_25":"Why would Floria do this to us!?",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_26":"Aidens ant juice is closed to depression\n\n\n\nMy family was killed by bees, but it was actually not the bees and that was a lie\n\nBut now our home is without power..",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_27":"My mom always told me I should pay for home insurance... But I always told her\n\n\"Why would I spend so much money! its not like my house will randomly be destroyed from erosion\"\n\nBuy home insurace.... don\'t take risks",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_28":"What? My house is destroyed?\n\nI have been writing Dragon Ball DAIMA",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_29":"Not only is there a HIGHWAY IN MY HOUSE... now there is a tree and a GOOP FLORIE...\n\n\nI think its time for me to move out",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_30":"Its a shame, now that we aren\'t in an alliance with Electrium we ran out of Elementium. Henry had only a few pieces left but he lended them to Cake Team so they could use it to build something...",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_31":"Heh, Magums making our life pretty challenging...\n\nBut us Ants will always march on one by one",
  "ctt_Antopolis_Book_32":"Anabelle will become my bride. we will face the end of the world together",

