  //Enchanted_Observatory_Book

  "ctt_Enchanted_Observatory_Book_1":"This place must have been built by my ancestors. It seems completely abandoned—only the lifeless golems remain, designed to protect this place from threats. Kind of sad, though… these golems are still trying to protect people who left long ago.\n- Quartz",
  "ctt_Enchanted_Observatory_Book_2":"The End.\n\nAn alternate dimension that winds together with the nether and the dimension we are in now.\n\nThe end was only a conspiracy theory. personalily I don\'t belive it exists\n\n-Professor Greg\n",
  "ctt_Enchanted_Observatory_Book_3":"But these \"end portal frames\" get me thinking...\n\nAncient technology far greater than anything humanity has created.\n\nIt looks like something must be placed inside to power it up... I\'m not\nsure what\n",
  "ctt_Enchanted_Observatory_Book_4":"Of course he had to send me here. Its only a matter of time before the occurances start.\n\nMy ancestors left this place centuries ago. Damnit I should have paid more attention in history class, they\'re probably in the end.\n\n-Quartz",

  //Devi_Castle_Book

  "ctt_Devi_Castle_Book_1":"You know, Neglected Wraiths just want a hug...\n\n...they just happen to kill you in the process.",
  "ctt_Devi_Castle_Book_2":"I have been alone for what has felt like years now...\n\nThere have been a few encounters with people finding my castle, but most days, we are alone.\n\nAt least here, I can\'t hurt anyone or myself.\n\n",
  "ctt_Devi_Castle_Book_3":"Gladiatus keeps texting me. I don\'t want anything to do with him. He just brings back bad memories...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-Devis Diary",
  "ctt_Devi_Castle_Book_4":"Universe A22\n\nIn this timeline, Nelfin was killed during the mission to Otherside. After her brother\'s death, Floria used Elementium in a fight of rage. ",
  "ctt_Devi_Castle_Book_5":"This surge in power caused Overgrown to spread as far as Devi’s Castle, eroding it down and morphing Devi to Floria’s will.",
  "ctt_Devi_Castle_Book_6":"When Floria\'s infection began taking over my body, the Demon Queen sacrificed herself to keep it from attacking my heart.\n\nI\'m saved from my curse…but at what cost?",

