  "ctt_Hollow_wood_Book_1":"Died too young...\n\nThey say his ghost still rooms around, taking over bodies and attacking people...\n\nEvery Friday the 13th he visits this grave",
  "ctt_Hollow_wood_Book_2":"Ever heard that this place is haunted...\n\n\nYears ago, a man was killed, his blood sucked dry...\n\n",
  "ctt_Hollow_wood_Book_3":"Its said he is searching for a higher power\n\nThey call him...\n\n\nThe Vampire",
  "ctt_Hollow_wood_Book_4":"Ever heard that this place is haunted?\n\n\nYears ago, people would hear scrapping outside... and suddenly, it would become night during the day... people would have trouble breathing... ",
  "ctt_Hollow_wood_Book_5":"They would wake up and there would be claw scrapes all over the village...\n\nThey call him..\n\n\nThe Dark Duck",
  "ctt_Hollow_wood_Book_6":"Ever heard that this place is haunted...\n\n\nYears ago, at night, the children would hear sounds in the forest. Swishing, and squishing, something slimey, creeping by...",
  "ctt_Hollow_wood_Book_7":"Its said that any candy that hasnt been eaten would be eaten by this monster\n\nThey call him...\n\n\nThe Jelly Man",

