  //The_Blossom_Pirates_Book

  "ctt_The_Blossom_Pirates_Book_1":"Hey Mom\n\nI\'m sorry I haven\'t been able to write back to you; it\'s been really busy.\n\nI understand that you\'re still upset with my decision, but I couldn\'t stay at home anymore...",
  "ctt_The_Blossom_Pirates_Book_2":"Our home was just not the same; I still think about the night it happened.\n\nBut my friends in the Dojo, they were broken, homes destroyed, loved ones dead.",
  "ctt_The_Blossom_Pirates_Book_3":"At least with us sailing the sea, sometimes we can just forget about all that and truly feel free again.\n\nI know you want me to return home, but I can\'t. My crew needs me more than anything.\n\n-Captain Blossom",

  //Kai_Treetops_Sign

  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Sign_1":"No",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Sign_2":"Humans",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Sign_3":"Bees",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Sign_4":"Or Ants",

  //Kai_Treetops_Book

  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_1":"\nDay 1\n\nI don\'t know where we are, all I know is that there are some freaky people here! Half birds... half people? All I know is they can fly.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_2":"\nDay 2\n\nAbas went to get some fire word for tonight. We had an interaction with one of the people, they are quite aggressive.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_3":"\nDay 3\n\nI\'ve started on some walls while Abas sets up fish catchers. We ended up taking some wheat from them while they were asleep, now we can make beds.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_4":"\nDay 4\n\nA lone explorer of their kind wandered close to our camp, we took them and hid them in a small spot we dug underground, hopefully we get some intell on what\'s going on this island.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_5":"\nDay 5\n\nAbas here, Traz is getting more fire word cuz we ran out again :p. Hope he doesn\'t realize I\'m using his journal!",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_6":"\nDay 6\n\nDuring the night I\'ve seen some eyes in the trees, I\'m not sure if I\'m hallucinating or if they\'re actually real.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_7":"\nDay 7\n\nThere has been some distant talk in the trees, I\'m not sure how much longer we can stay here for.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_8":"\nDay 8\n\nArrows were raided on us from above during the night. Me and Abas held them off for the entirety of it, we\'re exhausted.\n\nWe must leave.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_9":"\nDay 9\n\nWhile packing up in the early morning, we were attacked again, this time a bigger fleet came in. Blowing up our walls, throwing their spears at us, we took out most of them but left as there were too many to handle.",

  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_10":"\nThe Kai Journal\n+=---=+=---=+",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_11":"\nIt\'s been quite some time, but we\'ve finally settled in the trees.\nKleem said he saw a fire in the distance.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_12":"\nWe had thought nothing of it, but we were a bit skepticle of who else might be on this island.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_13":"\nWe woke up and noticed some of our hay supply was gone. Kyree was on night duty and reported two people going in and out.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_14":"\nKleem figured it must have been the people who started the fire on the beach, commanding one of the others to visit the camp and get intel.\n\nHe did not come back.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_15":"\nThe day after they went missing after exploring the camp, we sent a small militia to spy on them.\n\nDuring that night we took action and fired shots onto the camp, unfortunately we lost many of our own to whoever these people were.",
  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_16":"\nEnough was enough. We took advantage while they were caught off-guard, sending an even bigger militia to drive them out. We lost many more, but it seemed to work...",

  "ctt_Kai_Treetops_Book_17":"\nWe have a sense for despising other kinds.\nIf you\'re not a bird like us, don\'t think we\'ll be friendly to you.\n\nYou are a threat.",

  //Seized_Town_Book

  "ctt_Seized_Town_Book_1":"+=---=+=---=+\nThe year was 1813.\n\nI walked around like usual. Tending to the garden, greeting my neighbors, paying respects to the people who died to save this town. However, that was short-lived.",
  "ctt_Seized_Town_Book_2":"+=---=+=---=+\nA group of... people..? crossed the bridge, but they were holding guns and ammunition.\n\nShots echoed throughout the town, each house being invaded as I watched through my window, seeing my neighbors get slaughtered.",
  "ctt_Seized_Town_Book_3":"+=---=+=---=+\nAlthough, I was not going down for no purpose... I picked up what I had and began to fight, but it was useless.\n\nOne shot fired from the other side of the street, pinning me right in my heart...\n\n...",
  "ctt_Seized_Town_Book_4":"+=---=+=---=+\nI awoke on the ground, town abandoned, buildings on fire. I got up, but there was no blood, no wound, nothing... It almost seemed as if the bullet passed through me. I took my cat from my house as I wandered to the forest. ",
  "ctt_Seized_Town_Book_5":"\n\n\n\n-------------------\nI see a Tower in the distance, I wonder what it\'s there for.\n-------------------",
  "ctt_Seized_Town_Book_6":"+=---=+=---=+\nI\'ve been exploring for quite some time, finding some people along the way. A Green Knight, an Armored Explorer, and many more.\n\nIn my travels, I\'ve forged a Scythe thats helped me clear out some of the entities",
  "ctt_Seized_Town_Book_7":"+=---=+=---=+\nthat happen to reside here.\n\nI don\'t see an end anytime soon, but I\'m never willing to give up either.",

  "ctt_Seized_Town_Book_8":"\nI\'m just as surprised as you are to how I\'m still alive. I thought it was just my mind playing games, but when I realized my body didn\'t age, I figured this is how it was meant to play out.",

  //End_City_Book

  "ctt_End_City_Book_1":"This book will have stuff later",

  "ctt_End_City_Book_2":"\na wormhole has opened up inside of my mind\n\na wormhole has opened up inside of my mind\n\na wormhole has opened up inside of my mind\n\n",
  "ctt_End_City_Book_3":"\na wormhole has opened up inside of my mind\n\na wormhole has opened up inside of my mind\n\na wormhole has opened up inside of our mind\n\n",

  //The_Deep_Dark_Book

  "ctt_The_Deep_Dark_Book_1":"White Cake Log:\n\nWe are nearing the conclusion in obtaining enough Elementium; a process fraught with fatigue and tension. The monsters in these caves are quite hostile, especially the Wardens.",
  "ctt_The_Deep_Dark_Book_2":"It seems some monsters even started causing chaos in a nearby village. The public seems to hold us accountable, for that. Frankly, there may be some truth to their accusations. However, the benefits these resources afford the kingdom far surpass the drawbacks.",
  "ctt_The_Deep_Dark_Book_3":"-Professor Gregory\nAKA The Summoner",

