  //Sweet_Canyon_2_Book

  "ctt_Sweet_Canyon_2_Book_1":"I was getting ready for Christmas when a voice out of nowhere told me to head through a door. After stepping through it, I arrived in an entirely new place, and the voice instructed me to bake a giant cake right here",
  "ctt_Sweet_Canyon_2_Book_2":"It said I\'d be sent back to celebrate Christmas once I finished it. That\'s when I realized I could no longer leave through that same door",
  "ctt_Sweet_Canyon_2_Book_3":"I had no other choice — I had to get this task done. Every so often, new living gingerbread men would wander into this place, trapped here just like me",
  "ctt_Sweet_Canyon_2_Book_4":"A gingerbread man once tried to force his way out of this place, and he ended up dead. We were all terrified, so we assigned one of us to guard the door. We turn anyone away by claiming Christmas is not yet ready, and only unlock the door at the proper time",
  "ctt_Sweet_Canyon_2_Book_5":"This makes them believe the lie and wait quietly for the day to come. I hope this will bring down our death rate",
  "ctt_Sweet_Canyon_2_Book_6":"Terrible things keep happening. Every time we near finishing the cake, someone comes to stop us. We stand no chance against them. After our entire group is wiped out, we wake up again only to find the cake gone. Yet we have no choice but to keep going if we ever want to leave",
  "ctt_Sweet_Canyon_2_Book_7":"I’ve hidden this book here so the voice\'s owner won\'t find our plea for help. If anyone reads this, please save us",

  "ctt_Sweet_Canyon_2_Book_8":"We\'re about to start the final push, but why do my employees always insist on clocking out right on time?\n\nLately, a gang of cake thieves has been getting in our way too—let\'s hope they don\'t try to stop us when we move into that last phase",

