  //Summoner_Book

  "ctt_Summoner_Book_1":"The White Cake has given me a task…They want me to create life again, lets hope I do better this time-\n\nI have finally acquired enough elementium from Otherside to begin the cloning process- to start, I will fabricate a clone of myself",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_2":"After I am successful, I will begin cloning people that ascend the tower…Let\'s hope this goes better than my last attempt at creating life…",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_3":"The human body is easy to recreate; however, there is one thing that\'s impossible to make…A soul.\n\nEach variant I make needs a soul substitute; something I mix with Elementium to create something that mimics a soul. Its affect depends on the item used.",

  "ctt_Summoner_Book_4":"Test Subject S.2\n\nSoul Substitute:\nJelly Sandwich\n\nAge: 100 Days Old\n\n\nS.2 has finally decided on a name... SwanJelly\n\nSwanJelly is very underdeveloped.",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_5":"After the incident I was scared to go full power; so with SwanJelly I used a weak soul substitute and was very careful with him... which means he is developing at an extremely slow rate...\n\nHis skin is made entirely out of Jelly- almost like a red slime.",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_6":"I made him so I could study Swan some more. Turns out Swan is Canadian, although not sure if that will really help us...\n\nJoey bullies SwanJelly a lot- even tried to suck his blood; but Jelly didn\'t have any...",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_7":"SwanJelly is extremely annoying; he never shuts up. I\'m considering letting him free since he doesn\'t seem very dangerous. The only danger I could see is if he eats too many Chungus Burgers and dies of a heart attack.\n",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_8":"I\'ve decided to clone another Swan- this time with a little more juice. It\'s dangerous, but they don\'t call me the Summoner for nothing.",

  "ctt_Summoner_Book_9":"Soul Substitute:\nDark Ring\n\nAge: 10 Days Old\n\n\nS.3 has finally decided on a name... Dark Swan. This is the fastest a variant has ever decided on a name...\n",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_10":"It has been 5 years since the incident. Gladiatus warned me to not make another Swan; but after Swan Jelly, I think it\'s safe to make another as long as I keep an eye on it...",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_11":"We decided to keep Dark Swan inside. It\'s risky to let him out during field time...\n\nHe\'s quiet, and sounds sad a lot. The complete opposite of most Swans\'; usually they never shut up.",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_12":"One day he looked me in the eyes and said\n\n\"I\'m not the original am I\"\n\nI- I didn\'t know what to say, so I just told him no...\n\nI think hes plotting an escape- I always catch him talking with Joey",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_13":"I better keep an eye on him.",

  "ctt_Summoner_Book_14":"Dark Swan has escaped",

  "ctt_Summoner_Book_15":"Test Subject SU\n\nSoul Substitute:\nVampire Fangs\n\nAge: 50 Days Old\n\n\nSU has finally decided on a name- he decided his name will be Joey.",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_16":"Unlike his original copy, Joey has grown vampire fangs. There was an incident where he tried to suck Gregory\'s blood. Luckily, Devi and Gladiatus were able to break it up.\n\nI should bring cows and pigs for Joey to suck now so that he won\'t want to eat us.",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_17":"He has also been obsessed with this anime JoJo\'s bizarre adventure, which keeps him quite busy throughout the day. He plays this weird JoJo game too.\nI never know what he means when he talks about them; but as long as he\'s happy, whatever.\n",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_18":"Dark Swan and Joey seem to get along; however, I think they are plotting something…An escape?\n\nNo... Dark Swans too underdeveloped to plan things like that…But I should be careful.",

  "ctt_Summoner_Book_19":"Test Subject G\n\nSoul Substitute: \nLab Rat\n\nAge #140 Days Old\nTest Subject G has finally decided on a name for himself... Gregory.\n\nGregory hasn\'t shown any red signs that the last batch has shown",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_20":"Gregory has been regaining memories at a rapid pace. However, I am afraid he might start asking when he can leave. I cannot let him roam around; a variant is too dangerous unwatched. I must be very careful, even though I am certain Gregory will not have any incidents.",

  "ctt_Summoner_Book_21":"Test Subject S\n\nSoul Substitute:\n\n???\n\nAge: 132 Days Old",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_22":"It has been 132 days, and Test Subject S has yet to speak or do anything. He\'ll eat his meals... That\'s about it.\n\nI think using the ??? as a soul substitute was a little much... That item is far too powerful.",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_23":"It has now been 142 days, and Test Subject S has begun talking. He hasn\'t figured out a name yet; the first thing he said to me was:\n\n\"Tower\"\n\nHow does he know about the Tower? It\'s not even built yet?",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_24":"He opened his eyes and spoke again.\n\n\"I must reach the top.\"\n\nHe\'s freaking me out. The original Swan doesn\'t know about the Tower; perhaps the soul substitute gave him the knowledge.",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_25":"He then kept asking me questions.\n\n\"What\'s at the top?\"\n\n\"Where is the Tower?\"\n\n\"Can I climb it?\"\n\nHe has to be connected to the Tower in some way?",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_26":"At least he\'s talking now... I am worried, though.\n\nIt\'s a big day tomorrow; the Tower will be built.\n\nI\'ll have to leave Test Subject S alone for a bit.\n\nHopefully, nothing goes wrong.",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_27":"OH NO, THIS IS BAD!",
  "ctt_Summoner_Book_28":"Everyone is dead — he killed them all!! Oh God, this was a horrible idea... I knew creating a life without a soul would have consequences! How did he escape!? The only way to break it is from the outside!",

