  "ctt_Token_Shop_Book_1":"Welcome to the Cake\nTeam Towers 2026\nValentine\'s Event.\n\nEvery item in this\nlocation can be\nobtained with\nValentine\'s Command\nBoxes.",
  "ctt_Token_Shop_Book_2":"Every 100 Chocolate\nHearts collected will\ngive you a Valentine\'s\nCommand Box, two if\nyou are a Patreon\nsupporter. All\nValentine\'s Command\nBoxes have a chance\nto give these items\nand come with a pity\nmechanic where you\nare guaranteed to get cosmetics after failing enough times",
  "ctt_Token_Shop_Book_3":"You can earn up to\n100 Chocolate Hearts\na day this February\njust by climbing the\nTower. But you can\nalso get Chocolate\nHearts from various\nValentine\'s\nadvancements. Check\nthe Holiday\nAdvancements tab for\nmore info.",

  "ctt_Token_Shop_Book_4":"Like this is ever gonna happen",

