  //Heart_of_Otherside_Book

  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_1":"Getting a game over will continuously lower the total amount of XP and Tower Tokens obtained when completing this mission.\n\nIt will also set you back one difficulty Eclipse>Nightmare>Normal (Game over on Normal will not lower the difficulty)",
  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_2":"There are some special advancements for playing certain characters or on higher difficulties, check the Advancement tab for more info",
  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_3":"Sometimes, the thing you\'re looking for is right\nabove your head.",
  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_4":"I can\'t really remember what I saw when I used Elementium, but it was terrifying. There were... flashes of future events — some I hope I can prevent.\n\nBut I remember one thing:",
  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_5":"Those eyes.\n\nI will never forget those eyes.",

  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_6":"I don\'t exactly understand why we have to do all this, but I won\'t question my friends.\n\nWe\'re almost done. I can\'t wait to finish this work so I can sit back and watch anime at the top of the Tower!",
  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_7":"-Magum",

  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_8":"I think Devi is mad at me again.\n\nNo idea what I did this time...\n\nBut I don\'t have time to think about women. The Tower is so close to being completed.",
  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_9":"-Gladiatus",

  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_10":"I can\'t wait for this shit to be over.",
  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_11":"-Devi",

  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_12":"White Cake Log:\n\nWe are nearing the conclusion in obtaining enough Elementium; a process fraught with fatigue and tension. The monsters in these caves are quite hostile, especially the Wardens.",
  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_13":"It seems some monsters even started causing chaos in a nearby village. The public seems to hold us accountable, for that. Frankly, there may be some truth to their accusations. However, the benefits these resources afford the kingdom far surpass the drawbacks.",
  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_14":"-Professor Gregory\nAKA The Summoner",

  "ctt_Heart_of_Otherside_Book_15":"Once a rotation, their vision expands.\n\nOnly through the four children may the stars be reborn.\n\nUnseal the gates, and reveal their blessings.\n\nOnly then may ascent beyond the heavens begin.",

  //The_Black_Room_Book

  "ctt_The_Black_Room_Book_1":"To choose a human over our people... she has become too soft...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThat is why I must step in.",

  //The_Top_Book

  "ctt_The_Top_Book_1":"Old Explorer:\n\nI have finally reached the top of the tower.\n\nBut to my surprise, theres nothing up here... no gold, no hot babes, its empty...",
  "ctt_The_Top_Book_2":"No no no!\n\nI must have did something incorrectly there HAS to be something here...\n\nI\'ll just have to redo it, i\'ll just try again",
  "ctt_The_Top_Book_3":"and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again ",

