  "ctt_JELLY_4":"Hey Jellies!\n\nIts me, Swan Jelly.\n\nI built this obstical course to help improve my abilities... But feel free to use them\n\nTheres 4 levels, each that get harder, but im sure if you keep on climbing you\'ll reach",
